                  "code": "\n\tdata \u003d value[\u0027data\u0027]\n\t\t\n\tinstances \u003d []\n\tfilterStr \u003d value[\u0027filterStr\u0027].lower()\n\tif filterStr !\u003d \u0027\u0027:\n\t\tfor row in data:\n\t\t\tif filterStr in row[\u0027workOrderName\u0027].lower() or filterStr in row[\u0027itemName\u0027].lower():\n\t\t\t\tinstances.append({\u0027value\u0027: row})\n\t\t\n\t\treturn instances\n\telse:\n\t\treturn [{\u0027value\u0027: value} for value in data]\n",
